<47-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {1.55}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}After this verse, the \textdelta \ group manuscripts have two additional verses: \vspaceinnote \\ \devnote {\myvin mayi bodhāmbudhau svacche tuccho'yaṃ viśvabudbudaḥ/ pralīna udito veti vikalpapaṭalaḥ kutaḥ// \\ \myvin śrutipratītiḥ svagurupratītiḥ svātmapratītir manaso'pi rodhaḥ/ etāni sarvāṇi samuccitāni matāni dhīrair iha sādhanāni//}\lb \getsiglum {J10,C6,V3} have the following verses instead: \vspaceinnote \\ \devnote {\myvin kriyāyuktasya siddhiḥ syād akriyasya kathaṃ bhavet/ na śāstrapāṭhamātreṇa yogasiddhiḥ prajāyate// \\ \myvin na veṣadhāraṇaṃ siddheḥ kāraṇaṃ na ca tatkathā/ kriyaiva kāraṇaṃ siddheḥ satyam etan na saṃśayaḥ//\\ \myvin śiśnodararatāyeha na deyo veṣadhāriṇaḥ//} (cf. \emph {Dattātreyayogaśāstra} 42cd–43ab, 46–47ab)\\ These verses (except the last line) also appear in the \emph {Jyotsnā}, but after 1.64. }</47-x-2>
