<54-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {1.62}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}After this verse, \getsiglum {N23} has the following verse: \vspaceinnote \\ \devnote {\myvin sarvaśākamacākṣuṣyaṃ cakṣapyaṃ} (\textit {recte} \devnote {cākṣuṣyaṃ}) \devnote {śākapañcakam/ jīvantī vāstu matsyākṣī meghanādaḥ punarnavā//}\\ \getsiglum {V15,V3} have the following instead:\vspaceinnote \\ \devnote {\myvin kṣīraparṇī ca jīvantī matsyākṣī ca punarnavā/ meghanādaś ca pañcaite pañcaśākāḥ prakīrtitāḥ//} (\getsiglum {V15})\\ \devnote {\myvin kṣīravarṇī ca jaivantī matsāṣī ca punarnavā/ meghanādīti pañcaite śākanāma prakīrtitā//} (\getsiglum {V3})}</54-x-2>
